cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "The UAE's Role in the Horn of Africa: Claims, Evidence and Circulation"
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-23
authors:
  - family-names: Sugebo
    given-names: Abel W.
    affiliation: "Inform Africa/HaqCheck"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A register of 17 claims about the United Arab Emirates' role in Sudan, Somalia and
  Somaliland, Ethiopia and Eritrea, each rated on a five-level evidence scale, with
  monthly English and Arabic news coverage counts from Media Cloud (January 2025 to
  November 2026) and a coded collection of 89 X posts in five languages.
keywords:
  - information integrity
  - disinformation
  - Horn of Africa
  - Sudan
  - Somalia
  - Ethiopia
  - Eritrea
  - United Arab Emirates
  - fact-checking
  - media monitoring
